  stickyNoteTexts:
  - "Here\u2019s your next artifact. Another Indonesian artifact! Take good care
    of this one, Nova :)\n\nGood luck!\n\n-Ms. Maya"
  - "p.s I want to make sure of something: did your mom really move to the Netherlands
    in the 80\u2019s for work? She always sounded so cool to me... Like, she\u2019s
    an Indonesian archeologist abroad when only a small amount of Indonesians were
    able to afford any kind of higher education back in her times!"
